the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    *a thing* is goal.
    *a thing* is a p.
    *a thing* is a q.
    *a thing* is the r of *a second thing*.

the knowledge base metalevel includes:

the text of the ruleset is at "sources/metalevel.rules".

a thing is goal if
    the thing is a p
    and a second thing is a p
    and the thing is the r of a third thing
    and the thing is a q.

a thing is goal if
    the thing is a p
    and the thing is the r of a second thing.

scenario dataset is, as stated in the dataset:
    a is a p.
    b is a p.
    a is a q.
    a is the r of c.
    b is the r of c.
    goal expects answers ["a is goal", "b is goal"].

query goal is:
    which thing is goal.

